WEBVTT

00:00:00.950 --> 00:00:01.726
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:04.552
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> You <b>should</b> leave your boyfriend.

00:00:06.050 --> 00:00:07.640
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> She’s very stressed.

00:00:08.197 --> 00:00:09.909
She <b>shouldn’t</b> work so hard.

00:00:11.476 --> 00:00:14.341
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> You <b>shouldn’t</b> drink coffee in the evening.

00:00:14.497 --> 00:00:15.887
It’ll keep you awake.

00:00:17.947 --> 00:00:18.724
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:19.658 --> 00:00:21.941
<v><b>Speaker 3:</b></v> I think you <b>should</b> get a new job.

00:00:23.331 --> 00:00:25.380
I don’t think you <b>should</b> speak to him.